\section{Programming Instructions}
1. Access the ECU settings through the BMW Connected App.
2. Navigate to the 'Advanced Riding Modes' menu.
3. Select 'Custom Mode' and enable the 'Speed Bypass' feature.
4. Calibrate the throttle position sensor for optimal performance.
5. Confirm the bypass through the rider input switch located on the handlebar.
